<div id="ReportingContent" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiContent" data-tchmi-top="0" data-tchmi-left="0" data-tchmi-width="100" data-tchmi-width-unit="%" data-tchmi-min-width="932" data-tchmi-height="1390">
<div id="ReportingHeadline" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-left="32" data-tchmi-top="16" data-tchmi-height="32" data-tchmi-right="16" data-tchmi-text="Reporting" data-tchmi-word-wrap="True">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-class-names" type="application/json">
[
  "headline-2"
]
</script>
</div>
<div id="ReportingContainer" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiContainer" data-tchmi-left="16" data-tchmi-top="64" data-tchmi-right="16" data-tchmi-height="1310">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-class-names" type="application/json">
[
  "background-container"
]
</script>
<div id="ReportingDescription" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="24" data-tchmi-height="72" data-tchmi-right="24">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The extension TcHmiReporting creates PDF reports with the TwinCAT Reporting Server. Create report orders the report <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">Beckhoff</code> of the audit trail, the steps on the left show its configuration. Before the first report, install the package <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">TwinCAT.XAR.ReportingServer</code> and upload the files of step 1.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingSourcesText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="120" data-tchmi-height="96" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">1. Upload the scripts and the stylesheet</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">Once before the first report: on the Config page, open TcHmiReporting, Custom config, select the runtime <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">local</code> and upload each file under Upload CSS/JavaScript file. Or use the button below.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingSourcesCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="224" data-tchmi-height="126" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">ReportingSources/
    ReportingScripts/
        <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">Toolbox.js</span>   // Creates the entries
        <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">Images.js</span>    // Icons of the entries
    ReportingStyles/
        <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">TcHmi.css</span>    // Layout of the entries</pre>
</div>
<div id="UploadSourcesButton" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiButton" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="366" data-tchmi-width="160" data-tchmi-height="40" data-tchmi-text="Upload files" data-tchmi-word-wrap="False">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-trigger" type="application/json">
[
  {
    "event": "%ctx%owner::Id|EventRegistrationMode=Resolve%/ctx%.onPressed",
    "actions": [
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%ctrl%UploadSourcesState::Text%/ctrl%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "FunctionExpression",
          "functionExpression": "TcHmi.Functions.AuditTrailReportingSample.UploadReportingSources('local')"
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "Upload the files of ReportingSources and show the result"
  }
]
</script>
</div>
<div id="UploadSourcesState" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-left="200" data-tchmi-top="366" data-tchmi-width="264" data-tchmi-height="40" data-tchmi-text="" data-tchmi-word-wrap="True" data-tchmi-text-font-size="14" data-tchmi-text-font-size-unit="px" data-tchmi-text-vertical-alignment="Center">
</div>
<div id="ReportingReportText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="438" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">2. Runtime and report</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">The text field AuditTrail reads the audit trail.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingReportCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="494" data-tchmi-height="228" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">&quot;reports&quot;: {
  &quot;Beckhoff&quot;: {
    &quot;runtime&quot;: <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;local&quot;</span>,
    &quot;config&quot;: &quot;Beckhoff&quot;,
    &quot;textFields&quot;: {
      &quot;AuditTrail&quot;: {
        &quot;symbol&quot;: <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;TcHmiAuditTrail.GetAuditTrail&quot;</span>,
        &quot;value&quot;: &quot;...&quot;
      }
    }
  }
}</pre>
</div>
<div id="ReportingValueText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="754" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">3. Fill the text field with the entries</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;"><code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">{value}</code> is replaced by the audit trail entries.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingValueCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="810" data-tchmi-height="228" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">&lt;div class=&quot;auditEntries&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
    var parentElement =
        document.querySelector(&quot;.auditEntries&quot;);
    let toolbox = new <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">Reporting.Toolbox.Element</span>();
    // The value will be replaced while loading.
    let jsValue = <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">{value}</span>;
    let sortedValue = jsValue.sort((data1, data2) =&gt;
        data1.timestamp &gt; data2.timestamp ? 1 : -1);
    toolbox.<span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">createEntries</span>(parentElement, sortedValue);
&lt;/script&gt;</pre>
</div>
<div id="ReportingCreateText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="1070" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">4. Create the report from the HMI</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">The button orders it, the viewer loads the PDF.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingCreateCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="1126" data-tchmi-height="160" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">// Create report: onPressed
WriteToSymbol <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">%s%TcHmiReporting.OrderReport%/s%</span>
    value: &quot;Beckhoff&quot;

// ReportViewer: trigger
<span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">%s%TcHmiReporting.Diagnostics::reportsInProgress%/s%</span>
    {} and %i%ReportOrdered%/i%:
    File = &quot;/TcHmiReporting/reports/<span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">Beckhoff.pdf</span>&quot;</pre>
</div>
<div id="CreateReportButton" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiButton" data-tchmi-left="488" data-tchmi-top="120" data-tchmi-width="160" data-tchmi-height="40" data-tchmi-text="Create report" data-tchmi-word-wrap="False">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-trigger" type="application/json">
[
  {
    "event": "%ctx%owner::Id|EventRegistrationMode=Resolve%/ctx%.onPressed",
    "actions": [
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%ctrl%ReportViewer::File%/ctrl%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "StaticValue",
          "valueType": "tchmi:framework#/definitions/Path",
          "value": null
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      },
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%i%ReportOrdered%/i%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "StaticValue",
          "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Boolean",
          "value": true
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      },
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%s%TcHmiReporting.OrderReport%/s%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "StaticValue",
          "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/String",
          "value": "Beckhoff"
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "Clear the PDF viewer and order the report"
  }
]
</script>
</div>
<div id="ReportViewer" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiPdfViewer" data-tchmi-left="488" data-tchmi-top="176" data-tchmi-right="24" data-tchmi-bottom="24">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-trigger" type="application/json">
[
  {
    "event": "%s%TcHmiReporting.Diagnostics::reportsInProgress%/s%",
    "actions": [
      {
        "objectType": "Condition",
        "active": true,
        "parts": [
          {
            "if": [
              {
                "compare1": {
                  "objectType": "Symbol",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Object",
                  "symbolExpression": "%ctx%args[0]%/ctx%"
                },
                "compare2": {
                  "objectType": "StaticValue",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Object",
                  "value": {}
                },
                "compareOperator": "==",
                "logic": null
              },
              {
                "compare1": {
                  "objectType": "Symbol",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Boolean",
                  "symbolExpression": "%i%ReportOrdered%/i%"
                },
                "compare2": {
                  "objectType": "StaticValue",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Boolean",
                  "value": true
                },
                "compareOperator": "==",
                "logic": "AND"
              }
            ],
            "then": [
              {
                "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
                "active": true,
                "symbolExpression": "%ctx%owner::File%/ctx%",
                "value": {
                  "objectType": "FunctionExpression",
                  "functionExpression": "TcHmi.Environment.getHostBaseUri() + '/TcHmiReporting/reports/Beckhoff.pdf?t=' + Date.now()"
                },
                "asyncWait": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "else": []
          }
        ],
        "asyncWait": true
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "Show the report when the ordered report is finished"
  }
]
</script>
</div>
</div>
</div>
